    "identifier": "wind-release-divine-serial-waves",
    "description": "<p>You create a vortex where you can control the strength for the wind as it slices into its targets upheaving the ground upon impact from the force alone.</p>\n<p>Make a ranged ninjutsu attack targeting a creature you can see within range. On a hit target creature takes 8d6 wind damage and the affected creature must make a Constitution saving throw gaining 2 ranks of Bleed.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above B-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the number of creatures you can target with this jutsu by +1.</p>",
